WEBVTT

00:00:00.103 --> 00:00:06.051
This query creates an illustrative score out of four
component checks Each

00:00:06.077 --> 00:00:11.694
contributes twenty-five points That weighting is a
policy choice for

00:00:11.721 --> 00:00:17.311
teaching Another organization might value the
dimensions differently

00:00:19.035 --> 00:00:23.482
The important lesson is to keep the component checks
visible and avoid treating a composite

00:00:23.495 --> 00:00:25.035
score as an objective truth
